00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:19.500
We want whips though.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.280
We want big whips.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.000
That’s what we want.

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:24.100
We want everybody to be able to drive.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.240
If you trying to grip grain, you gotta get
breaded.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:39.440
I don’t even really step out to the pool
or anything ‘cause it’s not really worth

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:40.040
it for me.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:42.750
Things go left quick.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:43.750
I just get burnt bro.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.880
And my man over here, Urban, he gets tan.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.620
Like nice tan.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:52.520
And he’s like a little more cut than me
