00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.440
And I look okay, like don’t get me wrong,
I look alright.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.740
I be getting burnt.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.540
The back of my neck, my arms and shit.

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:02.460
